  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "If \\(m\\) and \\(n\\) are the roots of \\(x^2+mx+n=0,\\) \\(m\\ne0,\\) \\(n\\ne0,\\) then the sum of the roots is:",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(-\\dfrac12\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(-1\\)"
    },
